      "writtenOn": "2021-09-17T15:59:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Basically, the idea is - each hypervisor can figure out how to best determine its environment, and return an appropriate string\n\nFor AAOS, I can imagine we may run a GRPC-over-vsock server, and have the HAL impl. cache the response from the host upon first invocation. The host side can then do whatever it needs to provide useful output.",
